# Rampant Growth {1}{G}: "Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle" (CR
# 701.23). Forest and Mox Emerald pay the {G}{G} exactly; the Island found enters tapped and the library is shuffled.
# Bot2's own Islands stay in Bot2's library: the search is only of Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Rampant Growth
Forest x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rampant Growth.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Search(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
Bot2.Library.Count = 13
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
